  "description": "This makes a total of 20 servings of Perfectly Crisp Baked Chicken Wings. Each serving comes out to be 193 calories, 13.9g fats, 0.1g net carbs, and 16.4g protein.",
  "servings": 20,
  "yield": [
    "20",
