    "calories": 193,
    "netCarbsGrams": 0.1,
    "proteinGrams": 16.4,
    "fatGrams": 13.9
  },
  "ingredients": [
    "48 ounce bone-in chicken wings",
    "2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "1/4 cup butter (melted)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Place the chicken wings in a plastic bag. In a small bowl, mix together the baking powder, baking soda, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_0359.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the baking powder mixture into the bag with the chicken wings. Shake the bag very well to ensure that the wings are completely coated in the mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_0363.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the chicken wings on a wire rack and leave in the fridge overnight. This helps dry them out and breaks down the peptide bonds in the proteins of the chicken to give a crispier end result.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_0369.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next day, place a baking tray with a rack in the upper-middle part of the oven and preheat it to 450F. Once heated, place the chicken wings on the rack and bake for 20 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_0372.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and flip over. Bake for another 15 minutes or until very crisp.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_0379.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss with melted butter. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/perfectly-crisp-baked-chicken-wings/#wprm-recipe-51689-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
